  "boundary":"This programme discovers GUDID/openFDA UDI device-identification records. The exact Primary DI plus issuing agency is the device-record identity anchor; FDA-assigned record/public-version fields track updates to that public record. GUDID presence and submitted commercial-distribution state do not by themselves establish marketing authorization, current real-world availability, clinical effectiveness, exact assessed-system configuration, system conformance, automatic assessment reopening, or UNESCO/institutional endorsement. Premarket-submission and secondary/previous identifier fields remain linkage evidence requiring explicit human resolution."
